;Stormbolt:{{huh}}
;Unrelenting Force: A charged-up attack where a dragon shouts in a direction, those in the way of the shout will be knocked back, taking damage from the forceful impact as well.
;Forceful Impact: Knockback from unrelenting force that causes stunning.
;Raise Dead: Dragon will shout and a small graveyard will appear. Several elite skeletal Khajiit will then appear ([[Online:Skeletal Soldier|Skeletal Soldier]], [[ON:Skeletal Nightblade|Skeletal Nightblade]], [[ON:Skeletal Arcanist|Skeletal Arcanist]], [[ON:Skeletal Thundermaul|Skeletal Thundermaul]]). They will be supported by Bone Colossi.
