*[[ON:Yahgrondu|Yahgrondu]], a dragon with a sworn oath to Nahfahlaar, found in [[ON:Zazaradi's Quarry and Mine|Zazaradi's Quarry and Mine]] {{ESO DLC|Dragonhold}}
*[[ON:Yolnahkriin|Yolnahkriin]], a red dragon and one of the bosses in Sunspire {{ESO EL}}
*[[ON:The Dragon|The Dragon]], a luminary in the form of a white dragon {{ESO GR}}
*[[ON:Tho'at Shard|Tho'at Shard]], a glass atronach in the form of a dragon

