==Notes==
*A [[ON:Aspect of Alkosh|giant golden dragon]] can be seen in the [[ON:Spilled Sand|Spilled Sand]].
*Meteor Storm was previously seen in ''[[SR:Skyrim|Skyrim]]'' as the shout [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin]] used to burn down [[Lore:Helgen|Helgen]].
*The red and dark gray color scheme for generic dragonscour dragons is a reference to the two types dragons mentioned in ''[[ON:Mysterious Akavir|Mysterious Akavir]]''. White frost dragons and black storm dragons were later introduced in ''[[ON:Dragonhold|Dragonhold]]''.
**The black dragons are seen again in ''[[LG:Legends|Legends]]'' as the cards {{Card|Glacial Dragon}} and {{Card|Fallen Dragon}}.

